    title: "cuButterfly: Hardware-Mapped Space-Time Parallelism for Butterfly Computations on GPUs"
    authors:
      - given-names: "Teng"
        family-names: "Wang"
    year: 2026
    url: "https://github.com/TruNcat3/cuButterfly"
    notes: "Upstream design from which this port derives; BSD 3-Clause."
